  ('ins_v1_1', 'EOS-8', 'EOS', null, 8, '0-10', null, $q$How effectively does this organisation's strategy and direction translate into clarity, meaning, and purpose in your day-to-day work?$q$),
  ('ins_v1_1', 'Q1', 'QUAL', null, 1, 'TEXT', $q$Culture Strengths$q$, $q$What are the greatest STRENGTHS of this organisation's culture? What specific aspects of how things are done here make you proud to be part of this organisation? Please give concrete examples wherever possible.$q$),
  ('ins_v1_1', 'Q2', 'QUAL', null, 2, 'TEXT', $q$Culture Challenges$q$, $q$What are the most significant CHALLENGES in how things are done here? What specific cultural patterns, behaviours, or organisational norms frustrate you most? What gets in the way of the organisation being at its best?$q$),
